{"w":"Betelgeuse.","s":176.18,"e":178,"line":61},{"w":"Guys…","s":178.84,"e":179.54,"line":62},{"w":"Seriously…","s":180.28,"e":181.44,"line":63},{"w":"Why","s":182.34,"e":183.04,"line":64},{"w":"is","s":183.04,"e":183.48,"line":64},{"w":"Sirius","s":183.48,"e":183.96,"line":64},{"w":"doing","s":183.96,"e":184.38,"line":64},{"w":"that?","s":184.38,"e":184.84,"line":64},{"w":"I","s":185.52,"e":185.76,"line":65},{"w":"did","s":185.76,"e":185.94,"line":65},{"w":"not","s":185.94,"e":186.16,"line":65},{"w":"approve","s":186.16,"e":186.68,"line":65},{"w":"Sirius.","s":188.34,"e":188.52,"line":65},{"w":"I","s":189.9,"e":190.74,"line":66},{"w":"just","s":190.74,"e":191.78,"line":66},{"w":"wanted","s":191.78,"e":192.62,"line":66},{"w":"Betelgeuse.","s":192.62,"e":193.74,"line":66}],"lines":[{"s":0,"e":0.42,"text":"Look—"},{"s":0.94,"e":3.1,"text":"I don’t know what happened to the rest of the sky."},{"s":3.44,"e":5.3,"text":"I had one target."},{"s":5.86,"e":7.02,"text":"One red giant."},{"s":7.64,"e":10.4,"text":"One cosmic résumé bullet."},{"s":13.94,"e":15.36,"text":"Betelgeuse blinking like it owes me rent,"},{"s":15.36,"e":17.02,"text":"Big red star with a dramatic event,"},{"s":17.02,"e":18.94,"text":"I said, “That one’s mine when the heavens bruise,”"},{"s":18.94,"e":20.64,"text":"I just wanted credit for Betelgeuse."},{"s":20.64,"e":22.38,"text":"Told my friends, “Watch Orion’s shoulder,”"},{"s":22.3,"e":23.98,"text":"When it goes boom, my legend gets older,"},{"s":23.98,"e":25.6,"text":"I don’t need proof, I don’t need clues,"},{"s":25.6,"e":27.98,"text":"I just need headlines saying, “He called Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":27.98,"e":29.5,"text":"Then the sky went pop, pop, pop,"},{"s":29.5,"e":31.3,"text":"Like the universe forgot to stop,"},{"s":31.3,"e":33.46,"text":"Everybody looked at me confused,"},{"s":33.46,"e":36.98,"text":"I said, “Guys… I only ordered Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":36.98,"e":38.62,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse,"},{"s":38.62,"e":41.58,"text":"One star flash, one cosmic excuse,"},{"s":41.58,"e":44.98,"text":"Why’d the whole damn galaxy light the fuse?"},{"s":44.98,"e":50.8,"text":"I have no idea, I just wanted Betelgeuse."},{"s":50.78,"e":53.4,"text":"Yeah, I’ll take credit, sure, why not?"},{"s":54.02,"e":56.88,"text":"One red giant was the whole damn plot,"},{"s":57.48,"e":60.96,"text":"But when all the other stars blew loose,"},{"s":60.96,"e":65.18,"text":"I said, “That’s not me—I just wanted Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":65.18,"e":66.96,"text":"News crews came with the satellite vans,"},{"s":66.96,"e":68.48,"text":"“Sir, did you trigger the stellar collapse?”"},{"s":68.54,"e":70.22,"text":"I said, “No comment, but print my shoes,"},{"s":70.22,"e":72.5,"text":"And spell my name right under Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":72.5,"e":74.22,"text":"People believed me, which felt kinda bad,"},{"s":74.22,"e":75.86,"text":"I was half a prophet, half fully mad,"},{"s":75.86,"e":77.7,"text":"I pointed upward like, “That’s my muse,”"},{"s":77.7,"e":80.96,"text":"Then twelve constellations started filing lawsuits."},{"s":80.96,"e":82.84,"text":"Then the sky went bang, bang, bang,"},{"s":82.76,"e":84.48,"text":"Every zodiac sign joined the gang,"},{"s":84.48,"e":86.64,"text":"Pisces crying, Leo accused,"},{"s":86.64,"e":90.12,"text":"I said, “Please calm down—I just wanted Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":90.04,"e":91.78,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse,"},{"s":91.78,"e":94.74,"text":"One star flash, one cosmic excuse,"},{"s":94.74,"e":98.26,"text":"Why’d the whole damn galaxy light the fuse?"},{"s":98.26,"e":103.82,"text":"I have no idea, I just wanted Betelgeuse."},{"s":103.82,"e":106.7,"text":"Yeah, I’ll take credit, sure, why not?"},{"s":107.28,"e":110.04,"text":"One red giant was the whole damn plot,"},{"s":110.2,"e":114.16,"text":"But when all the other stars blew loose,"},{"s":114.16,"e":118.32,"text":"I said, “That’s not me—I just wanted Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":118.32,"e":121.8,"text":"Maybe I whispered too loud at night,"},{"s":121.72,"e":125.02,"text":"Maybe the cosmos took it as a fight,"},{"s":125.02,"e":128.22,"text":"Maybe Orion had unpaid dues,"},{"s":128.22,"e":132.16,"text":"Maybe heaven heard “all stars” when I said “Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":132.16,"e":135.26,"text":"I didn’t ask for Andromeda smoke,"},{"s":135.72,"e":139,"text":"I didn’t ask for the Milky Way choke,"},{"s":139,"e":142.1,"text":"I had one wish, one flaming excuse,"},{"s":142.1,"e":145.74,"text":"A tasteful explosion from Betelgeuse."},{"s":146.88,"e":150.04,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse,"},{"s":150.04,"e":153.04,"text":"One red boom for the evening news,"},{"s":153.04,"e":156.32,"text":"Now the universe is spilling juice,"},{"s":156.32,"e":159.94,"text":"And somehow I’m the guy who lit the fuse."},{"s":159.94,"e":163.18,"text":"I’ll take the crown, but hear my truth:"},{"s":163.18,"e":166.62,"text":"This got bigger than my little spoof,"},{"s":166.62,"e":170.2,"text":"If every star now starts to lose,"},{"s":170.14,"e":173.42,"text":"Don’t blame me, man—"},{"s":174.22,"e":178,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse."},{"s":178.84,"e":179.54,"text":"Guys…"},{"s":180.28,"e":181.44,"text":"Seriously…"},{"s":182.34,"e":184.84,"text":"Why is Sirius doing that?"},{"s":185.52,"e":188.52,"text":"I did not approve Sirius."},{"s":189.9,"e":193.74,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse."}],"duration":196.32,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-06-17T12:24:27.144Z","stats":{"whisperWords":461,"polishedWords":443,"matched":414,"matchRate":0.935}}